1. MTD
an MTD is "Memory Technology Device", these device is direct access by the host. e.g. NAND, NOR, ECC'd NOR, etc.

2. ramdisk
the flash device is simulated by memory


3. block device
The block device like MMC, eMMC, SD, CompactFlash, etc.
these device are not raw flashes, but they have a Flash Translation Layer inside. the host communication with the Flash controller, not care the flash issue,
the flash controller running FTL algorithms deal with wear-leveling, bad blocks handing, read-disturb and so on.

